; ===============================================================
;  Beam-input jitter study
;  No element errors — every seed gets the same lattice.  But the
;  *input beam* gets random centroid offsets, fractional emittance
;  variation, and beam-current jitter from ``ERROR_BEAM_STAT``.
;
;  Use case: source-stability tolerance budgeting.
; ===============================================================
TITLE Beam-input jitter
FREQ 325
PARTRAN_STEP 100 50
;
; --- Beam-error directive ---
;     r  dx  dy  dphi dxp dyp de  dEx dEy dEz mx my mz dIb
;        0.1 mm centroid jitter on x and y
;             0.5° phase jitter
;                  no divergence / energy centroid jitter
;                              5 % rel. emittance variation (x, y)
;                                              no Twiss mismatch
;                                                       1 mA current jitter
ERROR_BEAM_STAT 2 0.1 0.1 0.5 0 0 0 5 5 0 0 0 0 1.0
;
; --- Plain transport channel ---
DRIFT 100 20
QUAD 100 6 20 0 0 0 0 0 0
DRIFT 200 20
QUAD 100 -6 20 0 0 0 0 0 0
DRIFT 200 20
QUAD 100 6 20 0 0 0 0 0 0
DRIFT 200 20
QUAD 100 -6 20 0 0 0 0 0 0
DRIFT 200 20
END
